{"ID":"20240515131401-xs888pk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131401-xs888pk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131401-xs888pk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141653-kfwktym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141653-kfwktym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141653-kfwktym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:280,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:280\u0026#125;","title":"078","type":"doc","updated":"20240515172158"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141653-kfwktym","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 903px;","id":"20240515141653-kfwktym","updated":"20240515172158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LW"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"61 中瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/14"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n前診為肌肉萎縮，體力不好，診斷為癆症濕入血脈中。病人自述服前藥後，體力增加些，體重仍下降。服藥前三天大便稀，之後又回到硬如前。左下腹時痛，排氣出後痛即緩。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：口渴喜冷飲。有噯氣。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：雙手臂血脈縮小，體力增加些\n1、舌診：\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 血脈中濕，已排出部分。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同前方加厚朴三錢，代赭石三錢，淮山三錢，黃耆五錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(注: 前方為桂枝勺藥知母湯治癆症，小建中湯治病人胃口不好，苓桂甘棗湯去濕治帶脈痛)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便由硬轉軟表示血脈中的濕已出，但仍有濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴降腸之逆氣，代赭石降胃膽脾胰三焦之逆氣。淮山黃耆補氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}